+# Release testing
+
+## Clean setup
+Do not distribute or reuse archived `node_modules`. Install dependencies from the lockfile:
+
+```bash
+npm ci
+npx playwright install chromium
+```
+
+## Release smoke
+
+```bash
+npm run test:release-smoke
+```
+
+This runs poker correctness, grading consistency, navigation, Daily E2E and UI smoke tests.
+
+## Why node_modules is excluded
+The previously archived dependency directory was structurally incomplete (package roots such as Playwright/jsdom were missing their package metadata). The lockfile and package.json are the source of truth; a clean `npm ci` avoids shipping a machine-specific or corrupted dependency tree.
